    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present 48 The Courtyard, Castleredmond, to the market. This attractive B Rated three-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally positioned within this highly sought-after residential development and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\n\nExtending to approximately 88 sq. m., the accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, spacious living room and a well-appointed kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, along with a family bathroom.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a particularly spacious, mature and private garden which is not overlooked by neighbouring properties. The garden also features a patio area, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nThe wider East Cork area offers an excellent lifestyle, with a wonderful choice of beaches, coastal walks, sporting facilities, cafés and restaurants all within easy reach. Popular coastal destinations including Garryvoe and Ballycotton are easily accessible, while the nearby villages and towns offer a variety of restaurants, pubs and local amenities. Midleton itself is renowned for its vibrant food and hospitality offering, with a strong selection of restaurants, cafés and bars, making it an ideal base for enjoying both the convenience of town living and the more relaxed coastal lifestyle East Cork has to offer.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located home in a popular residential setting. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.36m x 1.82m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.47m x 3.44m\n\n\nGuest W.C - 1.68m x 0.97m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.36m x 2.68m\n\n\nDining Area - 3.36m x 2.67m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.20m x 3.93m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 2.48m x 0.92m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.20m x 2.88m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.05m x 2.75m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.92m\n\n\nLanding - 2.05m x 3.06m\n\n\n"
      },
